story_text.value:
People already come to <em>Claude</em> before buying a book. They ask what to read, whether a book is worth starting etc.<p>With coffeetable installed(a <em>claude</em> connector)<p><em>Claude</em> can now bring you few pages right inside the chat. 
What better way to decide you like a book than actually read a few pages<p>Also I recommend everyone ask <em>Claude</em>.
&quot;Based on everything you know about me, what are some books I must read&quot;

